Pex ships a PEX of itself for those who wish to download a Pex binary instead of pip installing it. Pants is an important user of the Pex PEX and f07ae4704df40968918b6b4f80fcfafbee1c4327 (via git bisect) introduced a performance regression that induces ~300ms of startup overhead over a v2.1.16 baseline.

