--- BEGIN ISSUE ---
Multiple elements with the same ID are rendering on the "Add Pageblock" form
In the "Add Pageblock" form, the modal forms render inputs with the `id` set to `id_label` and `id_css_extra`. Because there's multiple pageblock adding modals in the dom, that causes multiple elements with the same `id` to be rendered, which goes against the assumptions for an html ID. This causes input selection to behave strangely: I'm unable to select the inputs with a left-click in Firefox, I need to work around it by right-clicking.
The solution is just making these id's unique so they don't conflict with each other

